</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 302)</h2>
<p><b>Add clips mid-review — the web keeps up. And the proxies got better-looking.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Clips added to the playlist during a live web share are transcoded, encrypted and uploaded automatically; web reviewers see them in their clip list and follow you when you jump to one.</li>
<li>Web review proxies encode at roughly double the previous bitrate (about 29 Mbps at 1080p, High profile) so fire, grain and gradients survive the trip. Tunable per studio with the webshare.bitrateFactor default.</li>
<li>Difference view now renders on the web, the clip drawer floats and pins, and a &#947; slider trims display gamma for uncalibrated monitors.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
